{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"10ff1418916452a5","type":"group","x":-60,"y":-60,"width":600,"height":880,"label":"Mod ","background":"Assets/PrimedCryoRoundsMod.png"},
		{"id":"9841c84a69cbab22","type":"group","x":81,"y":471,"width":315,"height":124},
		{"id":"67aadb410fa80ea2","type":"group","x":-10,"y":657,"width":500,"height":73,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"fcce2cacc21cd275","type":"group","x":26,"y":774,"width":420,"height":60,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"1bdc602b1092e52e","type":"group","x":92,"y":598,"width":299,"height":60,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"07d360979da36691","type":"group","x":140,"y":-60,"width":200,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"bec98e248bb53898","type":"group","x":183,"y":709,"width":114,"height":60,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"c1b56d3e224e9e27","type":"group","x":413,"y":-11,"width":60,"height":60,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"366df70afc091b68","type":"group","x":473,"y":-10,"width":60,"height":60,"color":"3"},
		{
			"id":"86b51d6b0cbce7ee",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# **Polarity**\n\nIn the upgrade screen you will see that Mod Slots will often have a specific polarity. \n\n**Matching** Mods to their respective Slot Polarities **halves** their drain.\n\nMods that **do not** match with the respective Slot Polarity will **increase** the drain by **2**.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":620,
			"y":-60,
			"width":360,
			"height":260,
			"color":"3"
		},
		{
			"id":"664a7a5984a48c0a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Upgrade\n\nDescribed the effect this Mod has on your item.\n\nStatistical benefits will increase if you apply Fusion to the Mod.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-480,
			"y":480,
			"width":340,
			"height":205,
			"color":"2"
		},
		{
			"id":"aa224c253babfdca",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# **Name**",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-400,
			"y":360,
			"width":260,
			"height":80
		},
		{
			"id":"23b8e343ba1ec8de",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# **Equipped** Indicator\n\nUsually there is a glowing hexagon here when a mod is equipped.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-480,
			"y":840,
			"width":340,
			"height":141,
			"color":"6"
		},
		{
			"id":"dac0e38392606ef5",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Item\n\nThis determines the type of item this Mod can be installed in.\nIt may refer to a broad range of weapon types or a specific weapon.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":620,
			"y":620,
			"width":360,
			"height":205,
			"color":"4"
		},
		{
			"id":"18a3e80a52493847",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# **Fusion** / **Rank**\nYou can increase the level of a Mod through Fusion.\n\nThis will increase **both** its effectiveness and drain.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":20,
			"y":920,
			"width":280,
			"height":200,
			"color":"5"
		},
		{
			"id":"4a33abaa0ebe865e",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# **Drain**\n\nThis is the capacity cost for equipping the mod.\n\nSee [[Addressing Mod Drain]] to mitigate this.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":620,
			"y":-300,
			"width":360,
			"height":220,
			"color":"1"
		},
		{
			"id":"e2d8b310c7e442ba",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"# Rarity\n\nRarity is identified by the color of the frame on the Mod.\n\nGolden Mods are Rare, Silver Mods are Uncommon, and Bronze Mods are Common.\n\nPlatinum Mods are Legendary, often only obtained through Baro Ki'teer or daily login Milestone rewards. This usually includes Primed mods.",
			"styleAttributes":{},
			"x":-60,
			"y":-560,
			"width":440,
			"height":360,
			"color":"6"
		}
	],
